  "r:\"^Deal Curse damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and inflict (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> stacks\\. When the target has over ([\\d\\.]+)% HP remaining, increase skill damage by ([\\d\\.]+)%\\. If this skill defeats a target, activate this skill again \\(can be activated consecutively\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Flutter like a butterfly, then bring down the scythe to deal Curse damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Curse damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and inflict (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> stacks\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The enemy is entrapped within the petals of a cursed rose, dealing Curse damage\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Curse damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for each <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> stack\\. Also, when targets have (\\d+) or more Lovesick stacks, deal bonus Curse damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. After activating this skill, reset the duration of Lovesick stacks\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>With the power of love to her beloved Prince, deal Curse damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal Curse damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> can activate critical hits for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, activate all continuous damage effects on the target (\\d+) time, and activate Lovesick effect (\\d+) more times\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Curse damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^For each Chains of Love stack, increase Ichigo's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When Ichigo is present, increase party's continuous damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "The first time Ichigo activates Vorpal Butterfly, gain 1 Chains of Love stack. Also, each time she activates a Highlight, gain 1 Chains of Love stack. Chains of Love stacks up to 3 times.\\nGain the following effects based on the number of Chains of Love stacks.\\n1: For each <link\\=\"s|246\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> stack inflicted, increase target's damage taken by 4%.\\n2: Increase critical rate by 15%. Also, all of Ichigo's skill damage is counted as continuous damage.\\n3: Increase continuous damage by 25%.": "",
  "For each <link\\=\"s|246\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> stack inflicted, decrease target's Defense by 3%.\\nAlso, each time a skill is used, inflict 1 more Lovesick stack on the target.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 1 Chains of Love stack.\\nChains of Love now stacks up to 5 times, and gain the following effects based on the number of stacks.\\n4: Increase critical damage by 36%.\\n5: The first time Ichigo takes fatal damage, survive with 1 HP and enter a special near-death state, and gain 4 Poder of Love stacks. At the end each ally's turn, spend 1 Poder of Love stack, and after all Poder of Love stacks have been spent, Ichigo will be KO'd.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of My Beloved Prince and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Each time her Highlight is activated, permanently increase Ichigo's Attack by 6%. Stacks up to 5 times.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Vorpal Butterfly and Obsessive Rose by 3.": "",
  "<link\\=\"s|246\"><u>Lovesick</u></link> now stacks up to 15 times.\\nBased on the total number of Chains of Love stacks, the following effects can be activated. \\n1: After activating Vorpal Butterfly, activate Vorpal Butterfly 1 more time on the selected target.\\n2: After activating Obsessive Rose, activate Obsessive Rose 1 more time on the selected target.\\n3: After activating My Beloved Prince, activate My Beloved Prince 1 more time on the selected target.\\n4: During Ichigo's turn, can activate Highlight 1 time on the selected target without spending the Highlight gauge (not affected by Highlight cooldown time).\\n(Each effect can activate only once during battle. If a target is defeated or the skill is nullified, reflected, or absorbed, a different target is selected for the skill effect.)": "",
